BRIA AI RMBG 1.4

Source: https://huggingface.co/briaai/RMBG-1.4/tree/2ceba5a5efaec153162aedea169f76caf9b46cf8

The upstream model card identifies this model as source-available for
non-commercial use under bria-rmbg-1.4. Commercial use requires a separate
agreement with BRIA. These files retain those terms, not GenIA's licence.

Upstream licence link: https://bria.ai/bria-huggingface-model-license-agreement/
The original model card is preserved in rmbg.MODEL_CARD.md.
